{"availability":"available","full":"nirholas/scroll-zoom-thing","name":"scroll-zoom-thing","description":"CSS 3D perspective scrolling — a pure-CSS parallax. perspective on the scroll container pushes each layer back with translateZ; layers farther from the vanishing point move slower. scale() compensates so they fill the viewport. No JS, no scroll events — just the browser's natural 3D projection during scroll.","category":"Design","language":"CSS","stars":13,"forks":0,"created":"2026-04-21T04:28:17Z","updated":"2026-10-11T01:21:07Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://scroll-zoom-thing.pages.dev/","topics":["3d","agents-md","ai-agents","animation","css","css3","frontend","llms-txt","open-source","parallax","perspective","scroll","three-ws"],"demo":"https://scroll-zoom-thing.pages.dev/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T19:07:59.084Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T19:07:59.084Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T19:07:59.084Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T14:47:18.473Z","stars":13,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-09T15:35:25.018Z","stars":13,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-12T19:07:59.084Z","stars":13,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A pure-CSS 3D parallax MkDocs Material template. No JavaScript, no scroll listeners, no animation frame loops. Just perspective, translateZ, and scale(), plus a handful of AVIF layers, wired into the browser's own scroll rendering.","Live demo: scroll-zoom-thing.pages.dev (this repository, built and deployed to Cloudflare Pages).","The pai.direct and docs.pai.direct domains are offline while hosting is being migrated, so PAI links in this README point at the GitHub repository instead."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/nirholas/scroll-zoom-thing/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"c6eb0958e568b42f9e86900dfb26d1759818f4f59b16f2502784c17ed24e80a4","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T14:47:18.624Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T14:47:18.624Z","projectInsight